INSERT INTO `feed` VALUES (2360,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/technology/pope-ai-silicon-valley.html','As A.I. Fever Rises in Silicon Valley, Pope Leo Has a Few Words','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/technology/pope-ai-silicon-valley.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/00biz-pope-valley-PROMO/00biz-pope-valley-PROMO-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg','The American pope wants to take artificial intelligence down a notch. Is he challenging the tech companies, or will tech take over the papacy?','The American pope wants to take artificial intelligence down a notch. Is he challenging the tech companies, or will tech take over the papacy?','2026-05-25 12:35:03'),(2361,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/europe/pope-leo-encyclical.html','Pope Leo Warns of Risks From A.I. in 42,300-Word Encyclical','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/europe/pope-leo-encyclical.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25int-pope-encyclical-HFO-01-ktvm/25int-pope-encyclical-HFO-01-ktvm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The document marks a powerful foray by the leader of the Roman Catholic Church into the debate about the misuse or overuse of artificial intelligence.','The document marks a powerful foray by the leader of the Roman Catholic Church into the debate about the misuse or overuse of artificial intelligence.','2026-05-25 09:14:03'),(2362,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/europe/pope-leo-encyclical-ai.html','Pope Leo Has Released an Encyclical About A.I. Why Is That Important?','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/europe/pope-leo-encyclical-ai.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25int-pope-explainer-kmfp/25int-pope-explainer-kmfp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Leo XIV issued his thoughts about artificial intelligence in the modern world using a centuries-old form of papal communication called an encyclical.','Leo XIV issued his thoughts about artificial intelligence in the modern world using a centuries-old form of papal communication called an encyclical.','2026-05-25 03:40:10'),(2363,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/middleeast/iran-deal-trump-pressure.html','Trump’s Pressure Had Little Effect on Iran’s Terms for a Peace Deal','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/middleeast/iran-deal-trump-pressure.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/23/multimedia/trump-pressure-kjmp/trump-pressure-kjmp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','President Trump had sought to force Tehran to accept American demands for a peace deal with a mixture of threats and military operations.','President Trump had sought to force Tehran to accept American demands for a peace deal with a mixture of threats and military operations.','2026-05-25 09:05:11'),(2364,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/business/iran-strait-hormuz-shipping-traffic.html','Even After a Strait of Hormuz Deal, Moving 1,500 Ships Won’t Be Easy','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/business/iran-strait-hormuz-shipping-traffic.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25Biz-Strait-gqvp/25Biz-Strait-gqvp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','An agreement to reopen the waterway would be followed by a complicated process of navigating a backlog of vessels stranded for nearly three months.','An agreement to reopen the waterway would be followed by a complicated process of navigating a backlog of vessels stranded for nearly three months.','2026-05-25 08:55:52'),(2365,'https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/13/world/middleeast/abraham-accords-israel-arab-states-deal-trump.html','What Are the Abraham Accords, Trump’s 2020 Mideast Deals?','https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/13/world/middleeast/abraham-accords-israel-arab-states-deal-trump.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2025/10/13/multimedia/13int-Abraham-Explain-1-wmbc/13int-Abraham-Explain-1-wmbc-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The diplomatic agreements normalized relations between Israel and several Arab countries. Now, as part of the peace talks with Iran, Mr. Trump wants other states to join.','The diplomatic agreements normalized relations between Israel and several Arab countries. Now, as part of the peace talks with Iran, Mr. Trump wants other states to join.','2026-05-25 06:55:20'),(2366,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/tom-kean-new-jersey-missing.html','Absent Congressman Calls Allies, but Stops Short of Public Appearance','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/tom-kean-new-jersey-missing.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25met-kean-family-hvgw/25met-kean-family-hvgw-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Republican officials said they have talked to Tom Kean Jr., who has been absent from Congress for weeks. His office said Mr. Kean will eventually explain his absence.','Republican officials said they have talked to Tom Kean Jr., who has been absent from Congress for weeks. His office said Mr. Kean will eventually explain his absence.','2026-05-25 10:35:28'),(2367,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/trump-gop-fears-midterms.html','Trump’s Self-Indulgent Streak Deepens G.O.P. Fears He Is Risking Losses in Midterms','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/trump-gop-fears-midterms.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25pol-trump-midterms-01-kmfb/25pol-trump-midterms-01-kmfb-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg','“The stupid stuff is killing our chances,” said a retiring Republican senator.','“The stupid stuff is killing our chances,” said a retiring Republican senator.','2026-05-25 03:03:09'),(2368,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/saikat-chakrabarti-aoc-sf-pelosi-seat.html','He Name-Drops Ocasio-Cortez in His Bid for Congress. She Doesn’t Talk About Him at All.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/saikat-chakrabarti-aoc-sf-pelosi-seat.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/23/multimedia/23pol-pelosi-seat-02-lctz/23pol-pelosi-seat-02-lctz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Saikat Chakrabarti, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez’s former chief of staff, is running in San Francisco to succeed Representative Nancy Pelosi, whom Mr. Chakrabarti irked with an incendiary tweet seven years ago.','Saikat Chakrabarti, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez’s former chief of staff, is running in San Francisco to succeed Representative Nancy Pelosi, whom Mr. Chakrabarti irked with an incendiary tweet seven years ago.','2026-05-25 03:01:55'),(2369,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/constitution-framers-president-executive-monarch.html','Were the Constitution’s Authors a Little Too Optimistic?','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/constitution-framers-president-executive-monarch.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25DC-IDEAS-KING-top-new-cvkh/25DC-IDEAS-KING-top-new-cvkh-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The nation’s founding document has a blind spot. Trump is making it visible.','The nation’s founding document has a blind spot. Trump is making it visible.','2026-05-25 08:27:21'),(2370,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/business/economy/costco-curbs-skateboarding-genx.html','At an LA Costco, Skateboarding and Learning About Loss','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/business/economy/costco-curbs-skateboarding-genx.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/24/multimedia/24biz-Costco-Curb-03-bhtp/24biz-Costco-Curb-03-bhtp-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg','We’re all going to die. But first — just one more trick.','We’re all going to die. But first — just one more trick.','2026-05-24 11:00:12'),(2371,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/chemical-tank-garden-grove.html','Threat of Explosion From Toxic Chemical Tank Lessened, Officials Say','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/chemical-tank-garden-grove.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25nat-oc-tank-NEW-mvbp/25nat-oc-tank-NEW-mvbp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Evacuation orders remained in place for more than 40,000 residents around Garden Grove, Calif., the location of an industrial site containing an unstable tank of toxic chemical.','Evacuation orders remained in place for more than 40,000 residents around Garden Grove, Calif., the location of an industrial site containing an unstable tank of toxic chemical.','2026-05-25 14:06:50'),(2372,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/artificial-intelliegence-courts.html','Artificial Intelligence Floods Court Dockets with Home-Brewed Lawsuits','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/artificial-intelliegence-courts.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/23/multimedia/23dc-court-ai-jmlf/23dc-court-ai-jmlf-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','For years, courts have welcomed cases brought by self-represented litigants. Now those plaintiffs have A.I., and their filings are consuming more and more bandwidth.','For years, courts have welcomed cases brought by self-represented litigants. Now those plaintiffs have A.I., and their filings are consuming more and more bandwidth.','2026-05-25 03:00:44'),(2373,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/health/cholesterol-ldl-gene-therapy.html','One-and-Done Heart Disease Prevention? Scientists Show It May Be Possible.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/health/cholesterol-ldl-gene-therapy.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/science/25sci-cholesterol/25sci-cholesterol-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','A single infusion of an experimental gene-editing drug seemed to reduce LDL long-term in a small trial. The results may point to something “curative,” one expert said.','A single infusion of an experimental gene-editing drug seemed to reduce LDL long-term in a small trial. The results may point to something “curative,” one expert said.','2026-05-25 06:45:05'),(2374,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/us/waymo-robot-taxis-blind.html','Blind Waymo Users Revel in the Joy of Riding Alone','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/us/waymo-robot-taxis-blind.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/24/multimedia/24nat-waymo-blind-promo-cmkp/24nat-waymo-blind-promo-cmkp-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Waymo has been an object of frustration to some in California. For visually impaired people, it can also bring a rare feeling of independence.','Waymo has been an object of frustration to some in California. For visually impaired people, it can also bring a rare feeling of independence.','2026-05-24 05:41:35'),(2375,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/knicks-watch-party-garden.html','‘Bing Bong!’ The Knicks’ Watch Party Outside the Garden Is Dead.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/knicks-watch-party-garden.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/nyregion/25met-msg-rowdy1/25met-msg-rowdy1-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The police say that celebrations outside of Madison Square Garden have gotten out of control. Fans and insiders say the chaos has been driven by social media influencers.','The police say that celebrations outside of Madison Square Garden have gotten out of control. Fans and insiders say the chaos has been driven by social media influencers.','2026-05-25 13:26:23'),(2376,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/world/asia/can-concrete-molds-revive-coral-reefs-ruined-by-bombs-and-climate-change.html','Can Concrete Molds Revive Coral Reefs Ruined by Bombs and Climate Change?','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/world/asia/can-concrete-molds-revive-coral-reefs-ruined-by-bombs-and-climate-change.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/24/multimedia/24int-malaysia-corals-01-bgkz/24int-malaysia-corals-01-bgkz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','In a devastated section of the Coral Triangle in the Pacific Ocean, a conservation group is trying to build an artificial reef.','In a devastated section of the Coral Triangle in the Pacific Ocean, a conservation group is trying to build an artificial reef.','2026-05-24 21:48:45'),(2377,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/climate/al-gore-an-inconvenient-truth.html','Twenty Years After His Film, Al Gore Tweaks the Climate Script','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/climate/al-gore-an-inconvenient-truth.html','','Mr. Gore is still giving the slide show that “An Inconvenient Truth” was built around, but with changes that reflect a shift in the discussion of climate change.','Mr. Gore is still giving the slide show that “An Inconvenient Truth” was built around, but with changes that reflect a shift in the discussion of climate change.','2026-05-25 03:02:08'),(2378,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/weather/uk-heat-wave-may-weather-record.html','UK Heat Wave Could Break May Temperature Record','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/weather/uk-heat-wave-may-weather-record.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25wea-britainheatwave-kqfc/25wea-britainheatwave-kqfc-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Forecasters warned that temperatures could climb to the highest level ever recorded in the month of May, reaching 35 degrees Celsius (95 degrees Fahrenheit) in some areas of England.','Forecasters warned that temperatures could climb to the highest level ever recorded in the month of May, reaching 35 degrees Celsius (95 degrees Fahrenheit) in some areas of England.','2026-05-25 11:50:24'),(2379,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/books/review/summer-beach-reads.html','Summer’s Best Beach Reads','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/books/review/summer-beach-reads.html','','If you happen to be near a body of water (salt, fresh, chlorinated or otherwise), here are the books you’ll need.','If you happen to be near a body of water (salt, fresh, chlorinated or otherwise), here are the books you’ll need.','2026-05-25 08:05:56'),(2380,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/long-summer-memorial-day-labor-day.html','This Memorial Day Starts a Summer That Is Longer Than Most','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/long-summer-memorial-day-labor-day.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/20/multimedia/20xp-summer-02-mglv/20xp-summer-02-mglv-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','A calendar quirk brings more days of lemonade, glamping and difficult-to-open beach umbrellas to 2026.','A calendar quirk brings more days of lemonade, glamping and difficult-to-open beach umbrellas to 2026.','2026-05-25 10:19:36'),(2381,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/travel/summer-beach-getaways.html','New Waterside Getaways for the Summer','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/travel/summer-beach-getaways.html','','From the Hamptons to Majorca, here are six getaways that invite you to eat, drink, lounge and enjoy idyllic surroundings.','From the Hamptons to Majorca, here are six getaways that invite you to eat, drink, lounge and enjoy idyllic surroundings.','2026-05-25 03:01:44'),(2382,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/opinion/aging-advice.html','How to Be Old','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/opinion/aging-advice.html','','My advice for how to keep living.','My advice for how to keep living.','2026-05-25 08:38:09'),(2383,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/opinion/iran-trolling-propaganda.html','Iran Is Trolling Us and We’re Not Doing Anything About It','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/opinion/iran-trolling-propaganda.html','','This is a novel form of propaganda.','This is a novel form of propaganda.','2026-05-25 03:01:42'),(2384,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/sherrill-ice-delaney-hunger-strike.html','Gov. Sherrill Demands Access to ICE Facility as Hunger Strike Widens','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/nyregion/sherrill-ice-delaney-hunger-strike.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25Met-NJ-ice-hvjw/25Met-NJ-ice-hvjw-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Gov. Mikie Sherrill joined protesters at an immigration jail in New Jersey, the latest standoff between her and President Trump over his immigration policies.','Gov. Mikie Sherrill joined protesters at an immigration jail in New Jersey, the latest standoff between her and President Trump over his immigration policies.','2026-05-25 12:56:26'),(2385,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/canada/mark-carney-alberta-referendum-brexit.html','‘A Dangerous Bluff’: Carney Likens Alberta Referendum to Brexit','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/canada/mark-carney-alberta-referendum-brexit.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25int-carney-alberta-brexit-photo-qmbz/25int-carney-alberta-brexit-photo-qmbz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The Canadian prime minister, who was the governor of the Bank of England when Britain voted to leave the European Union, said the Alberta referendum on separating from Canada could backfire.','The Canadian prime minister, who was the governor of the Bank of England when Britain voted to leave the European Union, said the Alberta referendum on separating from Canada could backfire.','2026-05-25 13:33:36'),(2386,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/africa/baobab-tree-dying-madagascar-africa.html','One of Madagascar’s Oldest Sacred Trees Is Slowly Dying','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/africa/baobab-tree-dying-madagascar-africa.html','','In a forest in Madagascar, the demise of a centuries-old baobab points to the fraying of a fragile ecosystem.','In a forest in Madagascar, the demise of a centuries-old baobab points to the fraying of a fragile ecosystem.','2026-05-25 03:04:16'),(2387,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/americas/cuba-blackouts-fire-energy-oil.html','Cubans Cook With Charcoal and Wood Fires to Survive During Energy Crisis','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/americas/cuba-blackouts-fire-energy-oil.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25int-cuba-towers01-photo-kcmf/25int-cuba-towers01-photo-kcmf-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','The U.S. oil blockade has left millions without cooking gas. In Santiago de Cuba, the cradle of the Cuban revolution, apartment tower residents resort to charcoal and firewood.','The U.S. oil blockade has left millions without cooking gas. In Santiago de Cuba, the cradle of the Cuban revolution, apartment tower residents resort to charcoal and firewood.','2026-05-25 14:51:48'),(2388,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/middleeast/netanyahu-israel-hezbollah-lebanon.html','Netanyahu Says Israel Plans to Intensify Attacks on Hezbollah in Lebanon','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/world/middleeast/netanyahu-israel-hezbollah-lebanon.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25mideast-update-vjpt/25mideast-update-vjpt-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','After the prime minister made the announcement, the Israeli military said it had struck more than 70 Hezbollah sites in the past day.','After the prime minister made the announcement, the Israeli military said it had struck more than 70 Hezbollah sites in the past day.','2026-05-25 15:52:31'),(2389,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/pope-leo-encyclical-highlights.html','Main Takeaways From Pope Leo’s Encyclical on A.I.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/pope-leo-encyclical-highlights.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/26/multimedia/26nat-pope-annotations-SWAP-tjpq/26nat-pope-annotations-SWAP-tjpq-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','In his letter, the first American pontiff called for putting care for humans at the heart of technological change.','In his letter, the first American pontiff called for putting care for humans at the heart of technological change.','2026-05-25 15:16:24'),(2390,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/thomas-massie-2028-race.html','After Defeat, Massie Opens Door to a 2028 Run. Which Office Is Unclear.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/us/politics/thomas-massie-2028-race.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/25/multimedia/25pol-massie-hvbw/25pol-massie-hvbw-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Representative Thomas Massie of Kentucky, a critic of President Trump who lost his primary last week, filed papers for another candidacy but said he was not sure which office he might seek.','Representative Thomas Massie of Kentucky, a critic of President Trump who lost his primary last week, filed papers for another candidacy but said he was not sure which office he might seek.','2026-05-25 14:21:38'),(2391,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/arts/music/sonny-rollins-dead.html','Sonny Rollins, Giant of the Jazz Saxophone, Is Dead at 95','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/arts/music/sonny-rollins-dead.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2020/12/25/obituaries/00Rollins_Sonny1/00Rollins_Sonny1-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Even by the standards of a music that prizes individuality, he stood out, as both a musician and a personality.','Even by the standards of a music that prizes individuality, he stood out, as both a musician and a personality.','2026-05-25 19:41:01'),(2392,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/your-money/student-loans-repayment-save-biden.html','Student Loan Repayments Are Being Overhauled. What Borrowers Should Know.','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/your-money/student-loans-repayment-save-biden.html','https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/05/13/business/00student-loans/00student-loans-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg','Starting July 1, millions of borrowers will need to choose from a new menu of repayment options as the Trump administration enacts major changes to the student loan system.','Starting July 1, millions of borrowers will need to choose from a new menu of repayment options as the Trump administration enacts major changes to the student loan system.','2026-05-25 03:00:55'),(2393,'https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/business/ferrari-luce-electric-vehicle.html','Ferrari Unveils Luce, Its First Fully Electric Car','https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/25/business/ferrari-luce-electric-vehicle.html','','The Italian sports car maker unveiled Luce, its first all-electric model, on Monday amid wider worries about the luxury E.V. market.','The Italian sports car maker unveiled Luce, its first all-electric model, on Monday amid wider worries about the luxury E.V. market.','2026-05-25 14:10:06');
